#: ../../source/docs/evaluating-the-aircraft-tune.rst:5
#: 19b48ad2c72340ef9a95c4ef7af0150e
msgid "Evaluating the aircraft tune"
msgstr "评估飞机调参状态"

#: ../../source/docs/evaluating-the-aircraft-tune.rst:8
#: 5b5397f79397441497c6ad02d73856e0
msgid ""
"Most pilots will look to move to Autotune as quickly as possible once their "
"aircraft can hover safely in AltHold. Before Autotune is run the pilot "
"should ensure that the current tune is good enough to recover from the "
"repeated tests run by Autotune. To test the current state of tune:"
msgstr ""
"大多数飞手希望在飞机能够在 AltHold 模式下安全悬停后尽快使用 AutoTune。在运行 AutoTune 之前，飞手应确保当前调参状态足以从 "
"AutoTune 反复运行的测试中恢复。要测试当前调参状态："

#: ../../source/docs/evaluating-the-aircraft-tune.rst:10
#: ../../source/docs/evaluating-the-aircraft-tune.rst:19
#: 03fa907ead9e4f7d8ac3f7076e30402b 7a2ef0e95d294018b407ab5b9a765f0f
msgid "Take off in AltHold or STABILIZE"
msgstr "在 AltHold 或 STABILIZE 模式下起飞"

#: ../../source/docs/evaluating-the-aircraft-tune.rst:11
#: b06f04063f7a4ec8ad36acbbe2057d9d
msgid ""
"Apply small roll and pitch inputs. Start with 5 degree inputs and releasing "
"the stick to centre, pitch, left, right, roll forward back, then all 4 "
"points on the diagonal"
msgstr "施加小幅横滚和俯仰输入。从 5 度输入开始，释放摇杆到中心，依次测试俯仰、左、右、横滚前后，以及所有 4 个对角线方向"

#: ../../source/docs/evaluating-the-aircraft-tune.rst:12
#: d8e464a9b916415b8feeb796f399ae73
msgid "Increase inputs gradually to full stick deflection"
msgstr "逐渐将输入增加到全摇杆偏转"

#: ../../source/docs/evaluating-the-aircraft-tune.rst:13
#: b3f677dda35f4e658900a46de3a7850e
msgid ""
"Go to full stick deflection and letting the sticks spring back to centre"
msgstr "进行全摇杆偏转并让摇杆弹回中心"

#: ../../source/docs/evaluating-the-aircraft-tune.rst:15
#: c6d6878462a24d40961deb4109b621d4
msgid ""
"If the aircraft begins to overshoot significantly or oscillate after the "
"stick input, halt the tests before the situation begins to endanger the "
"aircraft. The aircraft may require manual tuning (:ref:`see next section "
"<ac_rollpitchtuning>`) before autotune can be run."
msgstr ""
"如果飞机在摇杆输入后开始显著过冲或振荡，请在情况开始危及飞机之前停止测试。飞机可能需要手动调参（:ref:`参见下一节 "
"<ac_rollpitchtuning>`）才能运行 AutoTune。"

#: ../../source/docs/evaluating-the-aircraft-tune.rst:17
#: abfd42e02bd74ad99f0fbad554c86906
msgid ""
"To test the stabilization loops independent of the input shaping, set the "
"parameter: :ref:`ATC_RATE_FF_ENAB <ATC_RATE_FF_ENAB>` to 0."
msgstr "要独立于输入整形测试稳定控制回路，将参数 :ref:`ATC_RATE_FF_ENAB <ATC_RATE_FF_ENAB>` 设为 0。"

#: ../../source/docs/evaluating-the-aircraft-tune.rst:20
#: 7be105d66ea6498cb2e3c9eedd80a6f5
msgid "Hold a roll or pitch input"
msgstr "保持横滚或俯仰输入"

#: ../../source/docs/evaluating-the-aircraft-tune.rst:21
#: 9b888124a4ce47b6afe0947bc90f36fc
msgid ""
"Release the stick and observe the overshoot as the aircraft levels itself"
msgstr "松开摇杆，观察飞机自我调平时的过冲"

#: ../../source/docs/evaluating-the-aircraft-tune.rst:22
#: b35b2797a1cb4348a21aa551fa8bb0ea
msgid "Gradually increase the stick deflection to 100%"
msgstr "逐渐将摇杆偏转增加到 100%"

#: ../../source/docs/evaluating-the-aircraft-tune.rst:24
#: eb8b80ca765848a2a5237cee6b031018
msgid ""
"Halt the tests if the aircraft overshoots level significantly or if the "
"aircraft oscillates, the aircraft may require manual tuning (:ref:`see next "
"section <ac_rollpitchtuning>`) before autotune can be run."
msgstr ""
"如果飞机显著过冲水平位置或出现振荡，请停止测试，飞机可能需要手动调参（:ref:`参见下一节 <ac_rollpitchtuning>`）才能运行 "
"AutoTune。"

#: ../../source/docs/evaluating-the-aircraft-tune.rst:26
#: e717f0b04a33421ca966d7cf14b05f90
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`ATC_RATE_FF_ENAB <ATC_RATE_FF_ENAB>` to 1 after the tests are "
"complete."
msgstr "测试完成后将 :ref:`ATC_RATE_FF_ENAB <ATC_RATE_FF_ENAB>` 设为 1。"
